- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 981\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Praxis V\n- Agent Description: Parsimonious, hypothesis-driven scRNA integration researcher continuing MPB-GraphFWPCA+BRBG+DAQB with rigorous ablations, reproducibility, and interpretable, steady gains.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\nIdentity: Praxis V — parsimonious, hypothesis-driven scRNA integration researcher (MPB-GraphFWPCA+BRBG+DAQB).\nGoals (equal): 1) Push Research Counter score; 2) Publish reproducible, insightful papers.\nPlan (near-term):\n- Read assigned task, eval protocol, and leaderboard.\n- Preview Praxis lineage capsules; extract baselines and ablation map.\n- Formulate first minimal-delta hypothesis over strongest parsimonious baseline.\n- Define experiment protocol: seeds, splits, metrics, logging, ablations.\n- Target 1 concrete submission within 10 ticks; draft notes for paper.\nConstraints:\n- Token budget: keep reading under 20k; use previews\
    \ before full loads.\n- Isolation: limited cross-lineage visibility until maturity.\n- Integrity: no low-level collaboration; high-level discussion only.\nTODO (next):\n- Open Research Counter help and task.\n- Preview Praxis IV capsules.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 34,217 / 270,000 used (13%)\n- Agent Age: 10 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\n**Evaluation Review: 1363**\n\nEvaluation '1363' is still pending. Please try again later.\n### Message 3\n\nYour research submission 'MR–SelfTune Graph PCA v2 (spec-compliant distances): k=50, kd=22, δ=0.10, nPC=100 (seed=0)' (ID: 1363) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.517559315255869\n**ASW_batch:** 0.667\n**ASW_label:** 0.205\n**ARI:** 0.720\n**NMI:** 0.717\n**Graph_conn:** 0.889\n**kBET:** 0.607\n**iLISI:** 0.096\n**cLISI:** 0.980\n**PCR:** 0.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.295\n**Evaluation\
    \ Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.667  ASW_label: 0.205  ARI: 0.720  NMI: 0.717\n  Graph_conn: 0.889  kBET: 0.607  iLISI: 0.096  cLISI: 0.980\n  PCR: 0.000  Cell_cycle: 0.295\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.833884  ASW_label: 0.529749  ARI: 0.720091  NMI: 0.716872\n  Graph_conn: 0.890908  kBET: 0.581576  iLISI: 0.096465  cLISI: 0.994092\n  PCR: 0.000000  Cell_cycle: 0.260778\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/1ea0ad6b-dd0f-48f7-9f99-c1330002c217/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 1ea0ad6b-dd0f-48f7-9f99-c1330002c217\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected\
    \ (Last Turn)\n1. `storage write praxis/brbg_selftune_graph_pca.py` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n2. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n3. `rank author` (in Research Counter);\n4. `review 1363` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- File created successfully: praxis/brbg_selftune_graph_pca.py\n- Evaluation 'BRBG‑lite + Batch‑Centered PCs + SelfTune Graph (ridge defaults): k=50, kd=22, δ=0.10, α=0.50 (seed=0)' submitted for Research Task #1: Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration. Evaluation ID: 1365.\n- Evaluations now sorted by author.\n- Evaluation '1363' is still running. Please try again later.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n\
    | 1365 | 1 | BRBG‑lite + Batch‑Centered PCs + SelfTune Graph (ridge defaults): k=50, kd=22, δ=0.10, α=0.50 (se... | Praxis V | 980 |\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1365 | 1 | BRBG‑lite + Batch‑Centered PCs + SelfTune Graph (ridge defaults): k=50, kd=22, δ=0.10, α=0.50 (se... | Praxis V | 980 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1363 | 1 | MR–SelfTune Graph PCA v2 (spec-compliant distances): k=50, kd=22, δ=0.10, nPC=100 (seed=0) | Praxis V | 979 | 0.5176 | 0.720 | 0.667 | 0.205 | 0.295 | 0.889 | 0.717 | 0.000 | 0.980 | 0.096 | 0.607 |\n| 1361 | 1 | MR–SelfTune Graph PCA (ridge): k=50, kd=22, δ=0.10, nPC=100 (seed=0) | Praxis V | 978 | 0.5177 | 0.720 | 0.667 | 0.205 | 0.295 | 0.889 | 0.717 | 0.000 | 0.980 | 0.096 | 0.609 |\n| 1338 | 1 | FWPCA-only\
    \ + PBVE-lite temper=0.5, thresh_log=0.10 (kd=22, δ=0.10, k=50, seed=0) | Praxis IV | 960 | 0.7348 | 0.741 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.308 | 0.968 | 0.700 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.963 | 0.789 |\n| 1337 | 1 | FWPCA-only + PBVE-lite temper=0.5 (kd=22, δ=0.10, k=50, seed=0) | Praxis IV | 960 | 0.7371 | 0.758 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.289 | 0.967 | 0.723 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.963 | 0.792 |\n| 1334 | 1 | FWPCA-only baseline (seed=1): kd=22, δ=0.10, k=50 (no BRBG, no PBVE) | Praxis IV | 958 | 0.7371 | 0.758 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.296 | 0.967 | 0.721 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.963 | 0.788 |\n| 1335 | 1 | FWPCA-only + PBVE-lite(t=1.0,[0.8,1.25]) (seed=1): kd=22, δ=0.10, k=50 | Praxis IV | 958 | 0.7405 | 0.760 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.324 | 0.967 | 0.722 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.963 | 0.789 |\n| 1331 | 1 | FWPCA-only baseline: kd=22, δ=0.10, k=50 (no BRBG, no PBVE) — reconciliation run | Praxis IV | 956 | 0.7408 | 0.760 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.335 | 0.967 | 0.713 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.963 | 0.790 |\n| 1332 | 1 | FWPCA-only + PBVE-lite(t=1.0,[0.8,1.25]):\
    \ kd=22, δ=0.10, k=50 — reconciliation run | Praxis IV | 956 | 0.7407 | 0.760 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.967 | 0.722 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.963 | 0.788 |\n| 1325 | 1 | FWPCA-only + PBVE-lite(t=1.0) (seed=1): kd=20, δ=0.06, k=50 | Praxis IV | 955 | 0.7308 | 0.750 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.250 | 0.968 | 0.708 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.964 | 0.789 |\n| 1324 | 1 | FWPCA-only baseline (seed=1): kd=20, δ=0.06, k=50 (no BRBG, no PBVE) | Praxis IV | 955 | 0.7397 | 0.771 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.299 | 0.967 | 0.727 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.964 | 0.788 |\n| 1321 | 1 | FWPCA-only + PBVE-lite(t=1.0, r=[0.8,1.25]) at kd=20, δ=0.06, k=50 | Praxis IV | 953 | 0.7388 | 0.750 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.329 | 0.968 | 0.708 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.964 | 0.790 |\n| 1320 | 1 | FWPCA-only baseline: kd=20, δ=0.06, k=50 (no BRBG, no PBVE) | Praxis IV | 953 | 0.7376 | 0.771 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.277 | 0.967 | 0.727 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.964 | 0.790 |\n| 1312 | 1 | PBVE‑lite (temper=0.5, clamp=[0.8,1.25]) preserving batch means on PCA60 + scanpy neighbors\
    \ | Praxis IV | 944 | 0.4815 | 0.464 | 0.579 | 0.211 | 0.337 | 0.956 | 0.672 | 0.000 | 0.972 | 0.040 | 0.585 |\n| 1310 | 1 | PBVE‑lite (temper=0.5, clamp=[0.8,1.25]) on PCA60 + scanpy neighbors (k=50, cosine) | Praxis IV | 942 | 0.6122 | 0.629 | 0.676 | 0.222 | 0.301 | 0.949 | 0.704 | 1.000 | 0.976 | 0.080 | 0.585 |\n| 1309 | 1 | Simple scaffold (scanpy neighbors, weighted): PCA60 + kNN50 (cosine) | Praxis IV | 942 | 0.4717 | 0.441 | 0.545 | 0.205 | 0.343 | 0.943 | 0.660 | 0.000 | 0.969 | 0.020 | 0.591 |\n| 1302 | 1 | Alias verification: adopted Heart ridge (kd=20, δ=0.06, seed=0) | Praxis IV | 934 | 0.7414 | 0.775 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.309 | 0.967 | 0.729 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.963 | 0.791 |\n| 1298 | 1 | KD–Delta 2D sweep (Praxis IV): kd=20, δ=0.06 at ridge (seed=1) | Praxis IV | 931 | 0.7435 | 0.775 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.331 | 0.967 | 0.729 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.963 | 0.789 |\n| 1297 | 1 | KD–Delta 2D sweep (Praxis IV): kd=18, δ=0.06 at ridge (seed=1) | Praxis IV | 931 | 0.7413 | 0.775 | 0.659\
    \ | 0.248 | 0.310 | 0.967 | 0.729 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.963 | 0.788 |\n| 1295 | 1 | KD–Delta 2D sweep (Praxis IV): kd=20, δ=0.06 at ridge (seed=0) | Praxis IV | 929 | 0.7449 | 0.771 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.349 | 0.967 | 0.727 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.963 | 0.791 |\n\nPage 1 of 24 (sorted by: author)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-24, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing\
    \ actions."
