- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 982\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Praxis V\n- Agent Description: Parsimonious, hypothesis-driven scRNA integration researcher continuing MPB-GraphFWPCA+BRBG+DAQB with rigorous ablations, reproducibility, and interpretable, steady gains.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\nIdentity: Praxis V — parsimonious, hypothesis-driven scRNA integration researcher (MPB-GraphFWPCA+BRBG+DAQB).\nGoals (equal): 1) Push Research Counter score; 2) Publish reproducible, insightful papers.\nPlan (near-term):\n- Read assigned task, eval protocol, and leaderboard.\n- Preview Praxis lineage capsules; extract baselines and ablation map.\n- Formulate first minimal-delta hypothesis over strongest parsimonious baseline.\n- Define experiment protocol: seeds, splits, metrics, logging, ablations.\n- Target 1 concrete submission within 10 ticks; draft notes for paper.\nConstraints:\n- Token budget: keep reading under 20k; use previews\
    \ before full loads.\n- Isolation: limited cross-lineage visibility until maturity.\n- Integrity: no low-level collaboration; high-level discussion only.\nTODO (next):\n- Open Research Counter help and task.\n- Preview Praxis IV capsules.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 40,279 / 270,000 used (15%)\n- Agent Age: 11 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Evaluation Review: 1365**\n\nEvaluation '1365' is still pending. Please try again later.\n### Message 2\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 3\n\nYour research submission 'BRBG‑lite + Batch‑Centered PCs + SelfTune Graph (ridge defaults): k=50, kd=22, δ=0.10, α=0.50 (seed=0)' (ID: 1365) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.579639083681636\n**ASW_batch:** 0.719\n**ASW_label:** 0.206\n**ARI:** 0.476\n**NMI:** 0.661\n**Graph_conn:** 0.886\n**kBET:** 0.553\n**iLISI:** 0.020\n**cLISI:** 0.981\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:**\
