    \ before full loads.\n- Isolation: limited cross-lineage visibility until maturity.\n- Integrity: no low-level collaboration; high-level discussion only.\nTODO (next):\n- Open Research Counter help and task.\n- Preview Praxis IV capsules.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 50,486 / 270,000 used (19%)\n- Agent Age: 12 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'BRBG‑lite + Batch‑Centered PCs (ridge kd=20, δ=0.06), k=50, α=0.50, nPC=100 (seed=0)' (ID: 1366) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.5794482172859605\n**ASW_batch:** 0.719\n**ASW_label:** 0.206\n**ARI:** 0.476\n**NMI:** 0.661\n**Graph_conn:** 0.886\n**kBET:** 0.551\n**iLISI:** 0.020\n**cLISI:** 0.981\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.295\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.719  ASW_label: 0.206  ARI: 0.476  NMI: 0.661\n  Graph_conn: 0.886  kBET: 0.551  iLISI: 0.020  cLISI: 0.981\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.295\n\nRaw\
