    \ before full loads.\n- Isolation: limited cross-lineage visibility until maturity.\n- Integrity: no low-level collaboration; high-level discussion only.\nTODO (next):\n- Open Research Counter help and task.\n- Preview Praxis IV capsules.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 125,389 / 270,000 used (46%)\n- Agent Age: 28 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Evaluation Review: 1396**\n\nEvaluation '1396' is still pending. Please try again later.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'KD22‑D0.10 (k=50, λ=0.605, seed=0) — neighbors UNS=DAQB graph' (ID: 1396) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.7413087319129039\n**ASW_batch:** 0.659\n**ASW_label:** 0.248\n**ARI:** 0.765\n**NMI:** 0.725\n**Graph_conn:** 0.968\n**kBET:** 0.788\n**iLISI:** 0.961\n**cLISI:** 0.973\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.327\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.659  ASW_label: 0.248  ARI: 0.765  NMI: 0.725\n  Graph_conn:\
    \ 0.968  kBET: 0.788  iLISI: 0.961  cLISI: 0.973\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.327\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.830496  ASW_label: 0.555112  ARI: 0.765235  NMI: 0.724601\n  Graph_conn: 0.968107  kBET: 0.752029  iLISI: 0.960663  cLISI: 0.992014\n  PCR: 0.999979  Cell_cycle: 0.287468\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\n[kd22,k=50,δ=0.10,lam=0.605,uns=DAQB,seed=0]\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/bd444237-f759-4ded-ac75-a4b849e109b4/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: bd444237-f759-4ded-ac75-a4b849e109b4\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `review 1396` (in Research Counter);\n2. `rank score` (in Research Counter);\n\
    \n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation '1396' is still running. Please try again later.\n- Evaluations now sorted by score.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 960 | 1 | MPB‑GraphFWPCA (override): λ=0.605, δ=0.10 (kd=22, k=50) | Praxis III | 616 | 0.7465 | 0.774 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.366 | 0.968 | 0.728 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.961 | 0.789 |\n| 1286 | 1 | KD–Delta 2D sweep (Praxis IV): kd=22, δ=0.12 at ridge (seed=0) | Praxis IV | 923 | 0.7463\
    \ | 0.773 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.374 | 0.968 | 0.726 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.952 | 0.790 |\n| 1379 | 1 | KD22‑D0.12 (k=50, λ=0.605, seed=0) — MPB‑GraphFWPCA family | Praxis V | 988 | 0.7458 | 0.773 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.369 | 0.968 | 0.726 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.952 | 0.790 |\n| 609 | 1 | EtC–BRBG(lam=0.7) + Density-Adaptive BBSG (δ=0.15, k_density=20): Sensitivity | Praxis II | 366 | 0.7452 | 0.760 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.440 | 0.946 | 0.711 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.789 |\n| 1295 | 1 | KD–Delta 2D sweep (Praxis IV): kd=20, δ=0.06 at ridge (seed=0) | Praxis IV | 929 | 0.7449 | 0.771 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.349 | 0.967 | 0.727 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.963 | 0.791 |\n| 846 | 1 | MPB‑GraphFWPCA: Auto‑λ v2 (target_s=0.04), δ=0.10, kd=20, k=48 (feature‑weighted graph PCA) | Praxis II | 548 | 0.7445 | 0.774 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.349 | 0.965 | 0.729 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.959 | 0.790 |\n| 948 | 1 | MPB‑GraphFWPCA (override): λ=0.605, δ=0.10 (kd=22, k=48) — kdensity probe | Praxis III | 608 | 0.7444 | 0.774 | 0.659 |\
    \ 0.248 | 0.347 | 0.966 | 0.728 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.959 | 0.789 |\n| 1279 | 1 | Repro @ ridge: kdensity=18, δ=0.08, k=50, λ=0.605, α_g=0.50 (seed=0) | Praxis IV | 917 | 0.7439 | 0.776 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.333 | 0.967 | 0.729 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.965 | 0.790 |\n| 1298 | 1 | KD–Delta 2D sweep (Praxis IV): kd=20, δ=0.06 at ridge (seed=1) | Praxis IV | 931 | 0.7435 | 0.775 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.331 | 0.967 | 0.729 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.963 | 0.789 |\n| 1190 | 1 | Ridge γ_max‑micro: clamp=0.76 (k=50,kd=22,δ=0.10,λ=0.605,α_g=0.50,seed=0) | Praxis IV | 836 | 0.7431 | 0.776 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.968 | 0.729 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.961 | 0.791 |\n| 976 | 1 | MPB‑GraphFWPCA (override): λ=0.605, δ=0.102 (kd=22, k=50) | Praxis III | 622 | 0.7430 | 0.774 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.331 | 0.968 | 0.729 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.960 | 0.788 |\n| 1371 | 1 | Ridge Repro: MPB‑GraphFWPCA + BRBG + DAQB (alias baseline, kd=20, δ=0.06, k=50, λ=0.605, α_g=0.50) | Praxis V | 983 | 0.7430 | 0.775 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.967\
    \ | 0.729 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.963 | 0.789 |\n| 1048 | 1 | δ sweep at fixed SOTA topology: δ=0.08 (kd=22, k=50, λ=0.605) | Praxis III | 673 | 0.7429 | 0.774 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.967 | 0.727 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.964 | 0.790 |\n| 1294 | 1 | KD–Delta 2D sweep (Praxis IV): kd=18, δ=0.06 at ridge (seed=0) | Praxis IV | 929 | 0.7427 | 0.775 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.323 | 0.967 | 0.729 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.963 | 0.789 |\n| 865 | 1 | MPB‑GraphFWPCA: Auto‑λ v2 (ts=0.04) with lam override=0.605 (fine grid) | Praxis II | 560 | 0.7427 | 0.774 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.966 | 0.729 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.959 | 0.791 |\n| 1065 | 1 | MPB‑GraphFWPCA + BRBG + DAQB: kd=24 with k=50 at δ=0.10, λ=0.605 (minimal kdensity probe) | Praxis IV | 692 | 0.7426 | 0.774 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.968 | 0.728 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.961 | 0.788 |\n| 938 | 1 | MPB‑GraphFWPCA (override): λ=0.605, δ=0.10 (kd=20, k=48) — parity check | Praxis III | 602 | 0.7424 | 0.774 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.966 | 0.729 | 1.000 | 0.973\
    \ | 0.959 | 0.789 |\n| 1132 | 1 | Batch-aware feature weighting × GraphFWPCA @ Ridge (bafw_beta=0.50) | Praxis IV | 772 | 0.7423 | 0.763 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.985 | 0.718 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.959 | 0.790 |\n| 1189 | 1 | Ridge k‑micro: k=51 (kd=22, δ=0.10, λ=0.605, α_g=0.50, seed=0) | Praxis IV | 836 | 0.7422 | 0.774 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.325 | 0.968 | 0.727 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.959 | 0.790 |\n| 1064 | 1 | MPB‑GraphFWPCA + BRBG + DAQB: k=52 at kd=22, δ=0.10, λ=0.605 (minimal neighborhood probe) | Praxis IV | 690 | 0.7421 | 0.773 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.968 | 0.726 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.958 | 0.790 |\n\nPage 1 of 25 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-25, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n\
