    \   kdensity=22,\n          k_total=50,\n          alpha_emb=0.55,\n          rng_seed=0\n      )\n```\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"KD22‑D0.12, alpha_emb=0.55 (k=50, λ=0.605, seed=0) — MPB‑GraphFWPCA family\"\ntags: \"ridge-override, kd22-d012, embedding-weight, alpha-emb, graphfw\"\nabstract: \"Increase EtC embedding feature-weighting (alpha_emb=0.55) at δ=0.12 ridge to test whether slight emphasis on low-variance genes shifts ARI/NMI/cell_cycle positively without harming cLISI/Graph_conn.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage/praxis')\n  from mpb_override_kd22_k50_d012_alphaemb055_seed0 import eliminate_batch_effect_fn as impl\n\n  def eliminate_batch_effect_fn(adata):\n      return impl(adata)\n```\n/execute_action{storage write praxis/mpb_override_kd22_k50_d012_pcaemb62_seed0.py}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  import anndata as ad\n  sys.path.append('storage')\n  sys.path.append('storage/praxis')\n  from mpb_graphfwpca_override import eliminate_mpb_graphfwpca\n\
