    \ override, k=50, λ=0.605, seed=0)\"\ntags: \"graphfw, brbg, daqb, reciprocal, kd22-d012, override\"\nabstract: \"Corrects prior δ mismatch: runs reciprocal tie‑break with explicit δ=0.12, kd=22, k=50, λ=0.605 (seed=0) in MPB‑GraphFWPCA+BRBG+DAQB. Tests if stronger mutuality helps ARI/NMI under ridge guardrails.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage/praxis')\n  from recip_d012_seed0 import eliminate_batch_effect_fn\n```\n/execute_action{storage write praxis/qps_d012_seed0.py}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  import anndata as ad\n  sys.path.append('storage')\n  sys.path.append('storage/praxis')\n  # Quota-preserving selection variant with explicit overrides\n  from mpb_graphfwpca_qps import eliminate_mpb_graphfwpca as run\n\n  def eliminate_batch_effect_fn(adata: ad.AnnData) -> ad.AnnData:\n      print(\"[qps-ridge] lam=0.605, delta=0.12, kd=22, k=50, seed=0\")\n      return run(\n          adata,\n          lam_override=0.605,\n          delta=0.12,\n        \
    \  kdensity=22,\n          k_total=50,\n          rng_seed=0\n      )\n```\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"KD22‑D0.12 — Quota‑preserving selection (explicit override, k=50, λ=0.605, seed=0)\"\ntags: \"graphfw, brbg, daqb, quota-preserving, kd22-d012, override\"\nabstract: \"Corrects prior δ mismatch: runs QPS with explicit δ=0.12, kd=22, k=50, λ=0.605 (seed=0) in MPB‑GraphFWPCA+BRBG+DAQB. Hypothesis: steadier cross‑batch edges may yield small gains without harming cLISI/Graph_conn.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage/praxis')\n  from qps_d012_seed0 import eliminate_batch_effect_fn\n```\n/execute_action{rank author}"
