    \nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Diagnostics: σ_kd distributions — Ridge vs FWPCA-only at δ=0.12 (kd=22, k=50)' submitted for Research Task #1: Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration. Evaluation ID: 1454.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1454 | 1 | Diagnostics: σ_kd distributions — Ridge vs FWPCA-only at δ=0.12 (kd=22, k=50) | Praxis V | 1032 |\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\
