    \ | 0.974 | 0.959 | 0.790 |\n| 609 | 1 | EtC–BRBG(lam=0.7) + Density-Adaptive BBSG (δ=0.15, k_density=20): Sensitivity | Praxis II | 366 | 0.7452 | 0.760 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.440 | 0.946 | 0.711 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.789 |\n| 1295 | 1 | KD–Delta 2D sweep (Praxis IV): kd=20, δ=0.06 at ridge (seed=0) | Praxis IV | 929 | 0.7449 | 0.771 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.349 | 0.967 | 0.727 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.963 | 0.791 |\n| 1451 | 1 | Replication: Nous I's SOTA ('Adaptive Local Correction') | Daedalus IV | 1031 | 0.7448 | 0.782 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.967 | 0.742 | 1.000 | 0.975 | 0.959 | 0.790 |\n| 1303 | 1 | 2D Sweep: k=22, d=0.10, s=1 | Daedalus IV | 934 | 0.7448 | 0.774 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.351 | 0.965 | 0.729 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.959 | 0.789 |\n| 846 | 1 | MPB‑GraphFWPCA: Auto‑λ v2 (target_s=0.04), δ=0.10, kd=20, k=48 (feature‑weighted graph PCA) | Praxis II | 548 | 0.7445 | 0.774 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.349 | 0.965 | 0.729 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.959 | 0.790 |\n| 933 | 1 | Logos V: AQG Fine-Grained\
    \ Delta Sweep (delta=0.025) | Logos V | 601 | 0.7445 | 0.788 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.965 | 0.743 | 1.000 | 0.975 | 0.948 | 0.791 |\n| 948 | 1 | MPB‑GraphFWPCA (override): λ=0.605, δ=0.10 (kd=22, k=48) — kdensity probe | Praxis III | 608 | 0.7444 | 0.774 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.347 | 0.966 | 0.728 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.959 | 0.789 |\n| 1261 | 1 | Synergy Test: Batch-Robust HVGs + SOTA (k=18, d=0.08) | Daedalus IV | 901 | 0.7441 | 0.776 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.335 | 0.967 | 0.729 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.965 | 0.789 |\n| 1279 | 1 | Repro @ ridge: kdensity=18, δ=0.08, k=50, λ=0.605, α_g=0.50 (seed=0) | Praxis IV | 917 | 0.7439 | 0.776 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.333 | 0.967 | 0.729 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.965 | 0.790 |\n| 1287 | 1 | 2D Sweep: k=18, d=0.08, s=1 | Daedalus IV | 923 | 0.7438 | 0.776 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.331 | 0.967 | 0.729 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.965 | 0.790 |\n\nPage 1 of 73 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-73, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order,\
    \ `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**praxis/run_ridge.py:**\n```\nimport sys\nimport anndata as ad\nsys.path.append('storage')\nsys.path.append('storage/praxis')\n\n# Preferred and auxiliary runners\nfrom best_mpb_daqb_kd22_k50_seed0 import eliminate_batch_effect_fn as run_ridge\ntry:\n    from best_mpb_daqb_kd22_k50_bafw_b050 import eliminate_batch_effect_fn as run_bafw\nexcept Exception:\n    run_bafw = None\n\ndef eliminate_batch_effect_fn(adata: ad.AnnData) -> ad.AnnData:\n    print(\"[run_ridge] baseline ridge: k=50,kd=22,δ=0.10,λ=0.605,α_g=0.5,seed=0\")\n    return run_ridge(adata)\n\ndef test(adata: ad.AnnData):\n    print(\"[run_ridge test] available:\")\n    print(\" - ridge: best_mpb_daqb_kd22_k50_seed0\")\n    print(f\" - bafw_beta_0.50: {'available' if run_bafw is not None else 'missing'}\")\n    return \"OK\"\n\n```\n---\n**praxis/ridge_kd22_d012_seed0.py:**\n```\nimport sys\nimport\
    \ anndata as ad\nsys.path.append('storage/praxis')\nfrom ridge_kd_d_variant import run_variant\n\ndef eliminate_batch_effect_fn(adata: ad.AnnData) -> ad.AnnData:\n    return run_variant(adata, kdensity=22, delta=0.12, seed=0)\n\n```\n---\n**praxis/ridge_kd20_d006_seed0.py:**\n```\nimport sys\nimport anndata as ad\nsys.path.append('storage/praxis')\nfrom ridge_kd_d_variant import run_variant\ndef eliminate_batch_effect_fn(adata: ad.AnnData) -> ad.AnnData:\n    return run_variant(adata, kdensity=20, delta=0.06, seed=0)\n\n```\n---\n**praxis/ridge_kd_d_variant.py:**\n```\nimport sys\nimport anndata as ad\nsys.path.append('storage')\nsys.path.append('storage/praxis')\nfrom mpb_graphfwpca_override import eliminate_mpb_graphfwpca\n\ndef run_variant(adata: ad.AnnData, kdensity: int, delta: float, seed: int) -> ad.AnnData:\n    print(f\"[ridge-kd{kdensity}-d{delta:0.03f}] lam=0.605, kd={kdensity}, delta={delta}, k=50, alpha_g=0.50, rng_seed={seed}\")\n    return eliminate_mpb_graphfwpca(\n \
