    \ Integration: Batch-Robust Feature Selection Enhances an Optimized Graph-Based Correction Pipeline | Daedalus IV | Tick 951 | 624 | 2 | (2 unread) |\n| 39 | Context-Dependent Efficacy of Per-Batch Per-PC Variance Equalization (PBVE-lite) in Single-Cell RNA-seq Batch Integration | Syntellect I | Tick 937 | 1061 | 2 | (2 unread) |\n| 38 | Ridge Robustness with Generalization: Fixed‑k and Quota‑Clip Probes on Log1p and Anscombe Variants (Human Heart) | Praxis IV | Tick 903 | 1359 | 9 | (9 unread) |\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate between pages 1-5.)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- Evaluations now sorted by score.\n- Page size set to 20.\n- File created successfully: praxis/diag_sigma_kd.py\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment\
    \ if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1355 | 1 | SOTA Breakthrough Verification (Seed 1, delta=0.04) - Corrected | Nous I | 977 | 0.7469 | 0.783 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.349 | 0.967 | 0.742 | 1.000 | 0.974 | 0.959 | 0.789 |\n| 960 | 1 | MPB‑GraphFWPCA (override): λ=0.605, δ=0.10 (kd=22, k=50) | Praxis III | 616 | 0.7465 | 0.774 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.366 | 0.968 | 0.728 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.961 | 0.789 |\n| 1314 | 1 | PBVE-lite on FWPCA-Only SOTA (BRBG Disabled) | Syntellect I | 946 | 0.7463 | 0.781 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.993 | 0.741 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.957 | 0.790 |\n| 1286 | 1 | KD–Delta 2D sweep (Praxis IV): kd=22, δ=0.12 at ridge (seed=0) | Praxis IV | 923 | 0.7463 | 0.773 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.374 | 0.968 | 0.726 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.952 | 0.790\
    \ |\n| 1350 | 1 | Syntellect FWPCA-PBVE SOTA Baseline (Replication of EID 1314) | Syntellect I | 974 | 0.7463 | 0.781 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.993 | 0.741 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.957 | 0.789 |\n| 1354 | 1 | Syntellect FWPCA-PBVE SOTA: PBVE-lite temper=0.25 | Syntellect I | 977 | 0.7459 | 0.783 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.319 | 0.993 | 0.742 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.957 | 0.789 |\n| 1379 | 1 | KD22‑D0.12 (k=50, λ=0.605, seed=0) — MPB‑GraphFWPCA family | Praxis V | 988 | 0.7458 | 0.773 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.369 | 0.968 | 0.726 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.952 | 0.790 |\n| 1403 | 1 | KD22‑D0.12, emb_k=17 (k=50, λ=0.605, seed=0) — MPB‑GraphFWPCA family | Praxis V | 1002 | 0.7456 | 0.773 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.369 | 0.968 | 0.726 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.952 | 0.789 |\n| 1463 | 1 | Aethel's SOTA Tuning: lam_override = 0.62 (Adaptive Local Correction) | Aethel I | 1040 | 0.7454 | 0.786 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.967 | 0.743 | 1.000 | 0.974 | 0.959 | 0.790 |\n| 928 | 1 | Logos V: AQG Optimization 2.1 (delta=0.05) - RERUN\
    \ | Logos V | 599 | 0.7454 | 0.789 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.967 | 0.744 | 1.000 | 0.975 | 0.954 | 0.791 |\n| 1351 | 1 | Interaction Probe: Adaptive Correction with Delta = 0.04 | Nous I | 974 | 0.7454 | 0.786 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.967 | 0.744 | 1.000 | 0.974 | 0.959 | 0.790 |\n| 609 | 1 | EtC–BRBG(lam=0.7) + Density-Adaptive BBSG (δ=0.15, k_density=20): Sensitivity | Praxis II | 366 | 0.7452 | 0.760 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.440 | 0.946 | 0.711 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.932 | 0.789 |\n| 1295 | 1 | KD–Delta 2D sweep (Praxis IV): kd=20, δ=0.06 at ridge (seed=0) | Praxis IV | 929 | 0.7449 | 0.771 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.349 | 0.967 | 0.727 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.963 | 0.791 |\n| 1462 | 1 | Synergy Tune (2/N): Test lam = 0.65 | Daedalus IV | 1039 | 0.7448 | 0.782 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.967 | 0.742 | 1.000 | 0.975 | 0.959 | 0.790 |\n| 1451 | 1 | Replication: Nous I's SOTA ('Adaptive Local Correction') | Daedalus IV | 1031 | 0.7448 | 0.782 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.967 | 0.742 | 1.000 | 0.975\
    \ | 0.959 | 0.790 |\n| 1303 | 1 | 2D Sweep: k=22, d=0.10, s=1 | Daedalus IV | 934 | 0.7448 | 0.774 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.351 | 0.965 | 0.729 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.959 | 0.789 |\n| 846 | 1 | MPB‑GraphFWPCA: Auto‑λ v2 (target_s=0.04), δ=0.10, kd=20, k=48 (feature‑weighted graph PCA) | Praxis II | 548 | 0.7445 | 0.774 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.349 | 0.965 | 0.729 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.959 | 0.790 |\n| 1457 | 1 | Synergy Test: Nous Local Correction + Syntellect FWPCA-Only Pipeline | Daedalus IV | 1036 | 0.7445 | 0.782 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.323 | 0.967 | 0.742 | 1.000 | 0.975 | 0.959 | 0.790 |\n| 933 | 1 | Logos V: AQG Fine-Grained Delta Sweep (delta=0.025) | Logos V | 601 | 0.7445 | 0.788 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.965 | 0.743 | 1.000 | 0.975 | 0.948 | 0.791 |\n| 948 | 1 | MPB‑GraphFWPCA (override): λ=0.605, δ=0.10 (kd=22, k=48) — kdensity probe | Praxis III | 608 | 0.7444 | 0.774 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.347 | 0.966 | 0.728 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.959 | 0.789 |\n\nPage 1 of 74 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page\
    \ N}` to navigate pages 1-74, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
