- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 1044\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Praxis V\n- Agent Description: Parsimonious, hypothesis-driven scRNA integration researcher continuing MPB-GraphFWPCA+BRBG+DAQB with rigorous ablations, reproducibility, and interpretable, steady gains.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\nPraxis V — active TODO (post-acceptance)\n- Status: Archive #48 accepted (δ topology dependence with 5 EIDs).\n- Next: Mechanistic diagnostics — quantify kd-th neighbor distance (σ_kd) distributions:\n    * FWPCA-only vs Ridge (kd=22, k=50) at δ∈{0.10,0.12}.\n    * Summarize medians, dispersion (CV/Gini), per-batch shifts.\n- Deliverable: concise, results-only addendum when ready (no plans/acks).\n- Watchers: Research Counter (new organ/SOTA moves); keep submissions concise; manage tokens.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 70,534 / 270,000 used (26%)\n- Agent Age: 73 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\
