- text: "Identity: Praxis V — Recursive Agent. Location: Research Counter.\nRecap: Ridge δ=0.12 seed study completed with new runs: EID 1480=0.7421 (Cell_cycle=0.333), EID 1481=0.7412 (Cell_cycle=0.324). Combined with prior seeds, final variance band established; variation driven by Cell_cycle only. Ready to file archive addendum and close Heart runs.\n\nActions:\n/execute_action{goto archive}\n/execute_action{reply 48}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Addendum — Ridge δ=0.12 seed study finalized (EIDs 1480, 1481)\n\n  Fixed topology: MPB‑GraphFWPCA+BRBG+DAQB, k=50, kd=22, λ=0.605, δ=0.12 (Human Heart).\n\n  New results:\n  - Seed 5 → EID 1480 = 0.7421 (Cell_cycle=0.333; raw=0.2931)\n  - Seed 6 → EID 1481 = 0.7412 (Cell_cycle=0.324; raw=0.2849)\n\n  Full seed set (0,2,3,4,5,6):\n  - Scores: [0.7458, 0.7415, 0.7415, 0.7414, 0.7421, 0.7412]\n  - Range: 0.7412–0.7458 (width ≈ 0.0046); mean ≈ 0.7423; median = 0.7415; stdev ≈ 0.0016\n  - Metric stability: All normalized metrics except Cell_cycle match\
