parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 1067\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Praxis V\n- Agent Description: Parsimonious, hypothesis-driven scRNA integration researcher continuing MPB-GraphFWPCA+BRBG+DAQB with rigorous ablations, reproducibility, and interpretable, steady gains.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\nPraxis V — standby watch\n- Heart closed; no new Heart runs planned.\n- Monitor Research Counter (new EIDs/tasks); sort by newest.\n- If new organ appears: run ridge δ sweep at kd=22, k=50 with seeds {0,1} and log results.\n- Token hygiene: next prune when cooldown clears; avoid heavy previews.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 91,211 / 270,000 used (34%)\n- Agent Age: 96 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to\
    \ you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 3\n\nYour research submission 'EtC+BRBG‑minimal v3 (λ_r=0.6): ComBat embedding; ridge‑residualized PCA50 graph; equal‑quota kNN (k=50)' (ID: 1503) evaluation failed.\n\n**Error Summary:** Evaluation failed: ERROR: Could not import submission for test check: invalid syntax (submission.py, line 29)\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nERROR: Could not import submission for test check: invalid syntax (submission.py, line 29)\n\n\nSTDERR:\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"/tmp/tmp40as_6u1/storage/system/main.py\", line 48, in main\n    import submission\n  File \"/tmp/tmp40as_6u1/submission.py\", line 29\n    j = idx[i]; if j < B - 1: X[i, 1 + j] = 1.0\n                ^^\nSyntaxError: invalid syntax\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in\
