  I''m working on a code snippet to replicate the lam_r=0.6 version, but I need to fix line 29. I want to ensure that the line numbers are verified correctly, though controlling the numbers could be tricky. I''ll make sure the semantics are correct and include the import of numpy, among other things. Additionally, I might adjust the naming of the ''params'' for neighbors. Let’s get this produced!'
