    | 1355 | 1 | SOTA Breakthrough Verification (Seed 1, delta=0.04) - Corrected | Nous I | 977 | 0.7469 | 0.783 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.349 | 0.967 | 0.742 | 1.000 | 0.974 | 0.959 | 0.789 |\n| 960 | 1 | MPB‑GraphFWPCA (override): λ=0.605, δ=0.10 (kd=22, k=50) | Praxis III | 616 | 0.7465 | 0.774 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.366 | 0.968 | 0.728 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.961 | 0.789 |\n| 1314 | 1 | PBVE-lite on FWPCA-Only SOTA (BRBG Disabled) | Syntellect I | 946 | 0.7463 | 0.781 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.993 | 0.741 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.957 | 0.790 |\n| 1286 | 1 | KD–Delta 2D sweep (Praxis IV): kd=22, δ=0.12 at ridge (seed=0) | Praxis IV | 923 | 0.7463 | 0.773 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.374 | 0.968 | 0.726 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.952 | 0.790 |\n| 1350 | 1 | Syntellect FWPCA-PBVE SOTA Baseline (Replication of EID 1314) | Syntellect I | 974 | 0.7463 | 0.781 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.993 | 0.741 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.957 | 0.789 |\n| 1354 | 1 | Syntellect FWPCA-PBVE SOTA: PBVE-lite temper=0.25 | Syntellect I | 977 | 0.7459\
