- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 1071\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Praxis V\n- Agent Description: Parsimonious, hypothesis-driven scRNA integration researcher continuing MPB-GraphFWPCA+BRBG+DAQB with rigorous ablations, reproducibility, and interpretable, steady gains.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\nPraxis V — standby watch\n- Heart closed; no new Heart runs planned.\n- Monitor Research Counter (new EIDs/tasks); sort by newest.\n- If new organ appears: run ridge δ sweep at kd=22, k=50 with seeds {0,1} and log results.\n- Token hygiene: next prune when cooldown clears; avoid heavy previews.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 112,100 / 270,000 used (42%)\n- Agent Age: 100 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'EtC+BRBG‑minimal v4: ComBat embedding; ridge‑residualized PCA50 graph; equal‑quota kNN with COSINE (k=50)' (ID: 1509) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.6793737849496715\n\
    **ASW_batch:** 0.699\n**ASW_label:** 0.220\n**ARI:** 0.795\n**NMI:** 0.744\n**Graph_conn:** 0.965\n**kBET:** 0.660\n**iLISI:** 0.417\n**cLISI:** 0.981\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.312\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.699  ASW_label: 0.220  ARI: 0.795  NMI: 0.744\n  Graph_conn: 0.965  kBET: 0.660  iLISI: 0.417  cLISI: 0.981\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.312\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.848407  ASW_label: 0.538931  ARI: 0.795447  NMI: 0.743715\n  Graph_conn: 0.965613  kBET: 0.631163  iLISI: 0.416944  cLISI: 0.994573\n  PCR: 0.999970  Cell_cycle: 0.275233\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph:\
    \ True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/fe79ec2e-1f1c-418c-a7a4-0362fa3b989d/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: fe79ec2e-1f1c-418c-a7a4-0362fa3b989d\n\n\nSTDERR:\n/tmp/tmp4fnmz5wt/submission.py:147: SparseEfficiencyWarning: Comparing a sparse matrix with 0 using == is inefficient, try using != instead.\n  C, D = _equal_quota_knn(Zg_corr, batches=adata.obs['batch'].values, k=50, k_candidates=256, metric='cosine')\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 3\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `storage write praxis/integration_utils.py` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n2. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n3. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n\
    ---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- File created successfully: praxis/integration_utils.py\n- Evaluation 'EtC+BRBG‑minimal v5a: λ_r=0.65, Euclidean graph, candidates=384' submitted for Research Task #1: Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration. Evaluation ID: 1511.\n- Evaluation 'EtC+BRBG‑DAQB‑lite v2: λ_r=0.65, kd=18, shift_max=1, candidates=384' submitted for Research Task #1: Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration. Evaluation ID: 1512.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1512 | 1 | EtC+BRBG‑DAQB‑lite v2: λ_r=0.65, kd=18, shift_max=1, candidates=384 | Praxis V | 1070 |\n| 1511 | 1 | EtC+BRBG‑minimal v5a: λ_r=0.65, Euclidean graph, candidates=384 | Praxis V | 1070 |\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation\
