tick: 1072
role: model
parts:
- text: "/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"EtC+BRBG‑minimal v5b: Cosine graph, λ_r=0.65, candidates=384 (k=50)\"\ntags: \"embed-then-correct, residualization, balanced-graph, cosine, quotas, knn\"\nabstract: \"Cosine variant of the minimal EtC+BRBG pipeline with larger candidate pool. X_emb=PCA60→ComBat. Graph=PCA50→ridge residualization vs batch (λ_r=0.65)→equal‑quota kNN (k=50, 384 candidates), cosine distance, binary symmetric connectivities with true distances; neighbors metadata set.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys, numpy as np\n  import anndata as ad\n  import scanpy as sc\n  sys.path.append('storage/praxis')\n  from integration_utils import normalize_log1p_counts, select_features, pca_svd, ridge_residualize_per_pc, equal_quota_knn, set_neighbors_meta\n\n  def eliminate_batch_effect_fn(adata: ad.AnnData) -> ad.AnnData:\n      # Preprocess + features\n      Xn = normalize_log1p_counts(adata)\n      Xn = select_features(Xn, adata)\n\n      # Embedding path (EtC)\n      Z_emb =\
    \ pca_svd(Xn, n_components=60, random_state=0)\n      ad_pca = ad.AnnData(X=Z_emb.copy(), obs=adata.obs[['batch']].copy())\n      sc.pp.combat(ad_pca, key='batch')\n      X_emb = np.asarray(ad_pca.X, dtype=np.float32)\n\n      # Graph path (BRBG‑minimal, cosine)\n      Z_graph = pca_svd(Xn, n_components=50, random_state=1)\n      Zg_corr = ridge_residualize_per_pc(Z_graph, adata.obs['batch'].values, lam_r=0.65, l2=1e-3)\n      C, D = equal_quota_knn(Zg_corr, batches=adata.obs['batch'].values, k=50, k_candidates=384, metric='cosine')\n\n      adata.obsm['X_emb'] = X_emb\n      adata.obsp['connectivities'] = C\n      adata.obsp['distances'] = D\n      set_neighbors_meta(adata, k=50, method='equal_quota+ridge_resid', metric='cosine', extra={'candidates': 384})\n      return adata\n```\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"EtC+BRBG‑minimal v5c: Cosine graph, λ_r=0.60, candidates=384 (k=50)\"\ntags: \"embed-then-correct, residualization, balanced-graph, cosine, quotas, knn\"\nabstract:\
    \ \"As v5b but with slightly softer residualization (λ_r=0.60). Tests whether reduced subtraction improves mixing (iLISI) while retaining ARI/NMI under cosine metric; k=50, 384‑candidate equal‑quota, binary symmetric connectivities; neighbors metadata set.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys, numpy as np\n  import anndata as ad\n  import scanpy as sc\n  sys.path.append('storage/praxis')\n  from integration_utils import normalize_log1p_counts, select_features, pca_svd, ridge_residualize_per_pc, equal_quota_knn, set_neighbors_meta\n\n  def eliminate_batch_effect_fn(adata: ad.AnnData) -> ad.AnnData:\n      Xn = normalize_log1p_counts(adata)\n      Xn = select_features(Xn, adata)\n\n      # Embedding path (EtC)\n      Z_emb = pca_svd(Xn, n_components=60, random_state=0)\n      ad_pca = ad.AnnData(X=Z_emb.copy(), obs=adata.obs[['batch']].copy())\n      sc.pp.combat(ad_pca, key='batch')\n      X_emb = np.asarray(ad_pca.X, dtype=np.float32)\n\n      # Graph path (cosine, λ_r=0.60)\n      Z_graph =\
    \ pca_svd(Xn, n_components=50, random_state=1)\n      Zg_corr = ridge_residualize_per_pc(Z_graph, adata.obs['batch'].values, lam_r=0.60, l2=1e-3)\n      C, D = equal_quota_knn(Zg_corr, batches=adata.obs['batch'].values, k=50, k_candidates=384, metric='cosine')\n\n      adata.obsm['X_emb'] = X_emb\n      adata.obsp['connectivities'] = C\n      adata.obsp['distances'] = D\n      set_neighbors_meta(adata, k=50, method='equal_quota+ridge_resid', metric='cosine', extra={'candidates': 384})\n      return adata\n```"
