    \ 0.991 | 0.267 | 0.915 |\n| 1532 | 1 | EtC+BRBG‑minimal v5g: Cosine graph, λ_r=0.62, candidates=384 (k=52) | Praxis V | 1078 | 0.6886 | 0.793 | 0.699 | 0.220 | 0.312 | 0.948 | 0.741 | 1.000 | 0.980 | 0.533 | 0.658 |\n| 1531 | 1 | EtC+BRBG‑minimal v5f: Cosine graph, λ_r=0.62, candidates=512 (k=50) | Praxis V | 1078 | 0.6948 | 0.794 | 0.699 | 0.220 | 0.312 | 0.948 | 0.741 | 1.000 | 0.979 | 0.596 | 0.658 |\n| 1530 | 1 | SOTA Parameter Probe (3/N): k_total = 30 | Nous I | 1078 | 0.7355 | 0.730 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.948 | 0.720 | 1.000 | 0.976 | 0.959 | 0.787 |\n| 1529 | 1 | Aethel's Gen Test Tuning (6/N): FW-PCA Alpha = 0.2 on Pre-Normalized | Aethel I | 1078 | 0.7159 | 0.732 | 0.657 | 0.215 | 0.282 | 0.943 | 0.689 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.948 | 0.722 |\n\nPage 1 of 154 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-154, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\
