    \ Adaptive Candidate Pool (λ_r=0.62, k=50, kq 256→512, kd=18)' (ID: 1539) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.6847401589529856\n**ASW_batch:** 0.699\n**ASW_label:** 0.220\n**ARI:** 0.793\n**NMI:** 0.745\n**Graph_conn:** 0.948\n**kBET:** 0.659\n**iLISI:** 0.489\n**cLISI:** 0.981\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.312\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.699  ASW_label: 0.220  ARI: 0.793  NMI: 0.745\n  Graph_conn: 0.948  kBET: 0.659  iLISI: 0.489  cLISI: 0.981\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.312\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.848407  ASW_label: 0.538931  ARI: 0.792653  NMI: 0.745391\n  Graph_conn: 0.949097  kBET: 0.630938  iLISI: 0.488849  cLISI: 0.994549\n  PCR: 0.999970  Cell_cycle: 0.275233\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn,\
