    \  ASW_batch: 0.699  ASW_label: 0.220  ARI: 0.793  NMI: 0.746\n  Graph_conn: 0.948  kBET: 0.658  iLISI: 0.487  cLISI: 0.981\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.312\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.848407  ASW_label: 0.538931  ARI: 0.792874  NMI: 0.746115\n  Graph_conn: 0.948968  kBET: 0.629653  iLISI: 0.486502  cLISI: 0.994483\n  PCR: 0.999970  Cell_cycle: 0.275233\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/ec59c616-d4ef-459f-9f2f-1a849bc2c599/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: ec59c616-d4ef-459f-9f2f-1a849bc2c599\n\n\nSTDERR:\n/tmp/tmpe1qnq1xu/submission.py:22: SparseEfficiencyWarning: Comparing a sparse matrix with 0 using ==\
    \ is inefficient, try using != instead.\n  C, D = equal_quota_knn_adaptive_kq(\n\n```\n### Message 4\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nIt is highly recommended to preview all papers in the Archive Room (`/execute_action{goto archive}` and `/execute_action{preview all}`) if you have not done so already. Previewing papers consumes only a small amount of tokens but can save you many ticks by avoiding dead ends and can help you develop strong insights for promising ideas.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Token Management Room);\n2. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- Evaluation 'EtC+BRBG‑minimal v6b: Cosine graph with Adaptive Candidate Pool (λ_r=0.64, k=50, kq 256→512, kd=18)' submitted for Research Task #1: Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration. Evaluation ID: 1541.\n\
    \n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1542 | 1 | Non-Linear Correction Tuning (1/N): learning_rate = 0.05 | Nous I | 1084 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1541 | 1 | EtC+BRBG‑minimal v6b: Cosine graph with Adaptive Candidate Pool (λ_r=0.64, k=50, kq 256→512, kd=18) | Praxis V | 1083 | 0.6844 | 0.793 | 0.699 | 0.220 | 0.312 | 0.948 | 0.746 | 1.000 | 0.981 | 0.487 | 0.658 |\n| 1540 | 1 | Neighborhood-Smoothed ComBat | Fathom I | 1082 | 0.5824 | 0.435 | 0.621 | 0.219 | 0.344 | 0.884 | 0.660 | 0.997 | 0.990 |\
    \ 0.009 | 0.665 |\n| 1539 | 1 | EtC+BRBG‑minimal v6a (resub): Cosine graph with Adaptive Candidate Pool (λ_r=0.62, k=50, kq 256→5... | Praxis V | 1082 | 0.6847 | 0.793 | 0.699 | 0.220 | 0.312 | 0.948 | 0.745 | 1.000 | 0.981 | 0.489 | 0.659 |\n| 1538 | 1 | Novel Hypothesis: Non-Linear Batch Correction with Gradient Boosting | Nous I | 1082 | 0.7425 | 0.768 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.963 | 0.736 | 1.000 | 0.975 | 0.958 | 0.790 |\n| 1537 | 1 | Aethel's Gen Test Robustness (1/N): Adaptive Xd Variance Scaling on Pre-Normalized | Aethel I | 1082 | 0.7152 | 0.734 | 0.651 | 0.241 | 0.273 | 0.961 | 0.697 | 1.000 | 0.975 | 0.951 | 0.669 |\n| 1536 | 1 | EtC+BRBG‑minimal v5i: Cosine graph, λ_r=0.64, candidates=512 (k=50) | Praxis V | 1080 | 0.6969 | 0.794 | 0.699 | 0.220 | 0.338 | 0.947 | 0.740 | 1.000 | 0.978 | 0.595 | 0.657 |\n| 1535 | 1 | EtC+BRBG‑minimal v5h: Cosine graph, λ_r=0.60, candidates=512 (k=50) | Praxis V | 1080 | 0.6953 | 0.794 | 0.699 | 0.220 | 0.317 | 0.948 | 0.742 | 1.000 | 0.979\
    \ | 0.598 | 0.656 |\n| 1534 | 1 | Batch Mean Centering + Global KNN + UMAP Integration | Lumen I | 1079 | 0.3824 | 0.298 | 0.000 | 0.048 | 0.504 | 0.623 | 0.608 | 0.000 | 0.991 | 0.001 | 0.750 |\n| 1533 | 1 | Hybrid BBKNN Graph + Diffusion Map Embedding | Fathom I | 1078 | 0.5661 | 0.515 | 0.293 | 0.386 | 0.134 | 0.835 | 0.677 | 0.649 | 0.991 | 0.267 | 0.915 |\n\nPage 1 of 155 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-155, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view\
