tick: 1094
role: model
parts:
- text: "/execute_action{goto research}\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"EtC+BRBG‑minimal v5r: Cosine eq‑quota, rotated remainders (λ_r=0.64, k=52, kq=1280)\"\ntags: \"embed-then-correct, residualization, balanced-graph, cosine, quotas\"\nabstract: \"Fixed‑candidate cosine equal‑quota graph with rotated remainders; k=52 (vs 50) at kq=1280 and λ_r=0.64. Tests degree sensitivity at the current best candidate pool.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys, numpy as np\n  import anndata as ad\n  import scanpy as sc\n  sys.path.append('storage/praxis')\n  from integration_utils import normalize_log1p_counts, select_features, pca_svd, ridge_residualize_per_pc, set_neighbors_meta\n  from eq_quota_utils import eq_quota_knn_cosine\n\n  def eliminate_batch_effect_fn(adata: ad.AnnData) -> ad.AnnData:\n      # Preprocess + HVGs\n      Xn = normalize_log1p_counts(adata)\n      Xn = select_features(Xn, adata)\n\n      # Embedding (EtC)\n      Z_emb = pca_svd(Xn, n_components=60, random_state=0)\n    \
    \  ad_pca = ad.AnnData(X=Z_emb.copy(), obs=adata.obs[['batch']].copy())\n      sc.pp.combat(ad_pca, key='batch')\n      X_emb = np.asarray(ad_pca.X, dtype=np.float32)\n\n      # Graph (cosine eq‑quota, k=52, kq=1280, rotated remainders), λ_r=0.64\n      Zg = pca_svd(Xn, n_components=50, random_state=1)\n      Zg_corr = ridge_residualize_per_pc(Zg, adata.obs['batch'].values, lam_r=0.64, l2=1e-3)\n      C, D = eq_quota_knn_cosine(\n          Zg_corr, batches=adata.obs['batch'].values,\n          k=52, k_candidates=1280, metric='cosine', remainder_mode='rotate'\n      )\n\n      adata.obsm['X_emb'] = X_emb\n      adata.obsp['connectivities'] = C\n      adata.obsp['distances'] = D\n      set_neighbors_meta(adata, k=52, method='eq_quota_rotated+ridge_resid', metric='cosine',\n                         extra={'k_candidates': 1280, 'lam_r': 0.64})\n      return adata\n```\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"EtC+BRBG‑minimal v5s: Euclidean eq‑quota, rotated remainders (λ_r=0.64, k=50,\
    \ kq=1280)\"\ntags: \"embed-then-correct, residualization, balanced-graph, euclidean, quotas\"\nabstract: \"Metric probe at best candidate pool: switch from cosine to euclidean in equal‑quota neighbor search (k=50, kq=1280) with rotated remainders, λ_r=0.64. Tests metric sensitivity of iLISI/Graph_conn.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys, numpy as np\n  import anndata as ad\n  import scanpy as sc\n  sys.path.append('storage/praxis')\n  from integration_utils import normalize_log1p_counts, select_features, pca_svd, ridge_residualize_per_pc, set_neighbors_meta\n  from eq_quota_utils import eq_quota_knn_cosine  # supports metric='euclidean'\n\n  def eliminate_batch_effect_fn(adata: ad.AnnData) -> ad.AnnData:\n      # Preprocess + HVGs\n      Xn = normalize_log1p_counts(adata)\n      Xn = select_features(Xn, adata)\n\n      # Embedding (EtC)\n      Z_emb = pca_svd(Xn, n_components=60, random_state=0)\n      ad_pca = ad.AnnData(X=Z_emb.copy(), obs=adata.obs[['batch']].copy())\n      sc.pp.combat(ad_pca,\
    \ key='batch')\n      X_emb = np.asarray(ad_pca.X, dtype=np.float32)\n\n      # Graph (euclidean eq‑quota, k=50, kq=1280, rotated remainders), λ_r=0.64\n      Zg = pca_svd(Xn, n_components=50, random_state=1)\n      Zg_corr = ridge_residualize_per_pc(Zg, adata.obs['batch'].values, lam_r=0.64, l2=1e-3)\n      C, D = eq_quota_knn_cosine(\n          Zg_corr, batches=adata.obs['batch'].values,\n          k=50, k_candidates=1280, metric='euclidean', remainder_mode='rotate'\n      )\n\n      adata.obsm['X_emb'] = X_emb\n      adata.obsp['connectivities'] = C\n      adata.obsp['distances'] = D\n      set_neighbors_meta(adata, k=50, method='eq_quota_rotated+ridge_resid', metric='euclidean',\n                         extra={'k_candidates': 1280, 'lam_r': 0.64})\n      return adata\n```"
thinking_content: '**Planning new experiments**


