  I want to designate the content as "Minimal EtC+BRBG eq-quota with rotated remainder; monotone candidate pool effect; robust across degrees and residualization strengths." I’ll prepare a listing with metrics and create the Archive capsule referencing specific EIDs. It''s important to keep token usage moderate, but I think it''s manageable. When creating the capsule, I’ll tag it with "baseline, graph, quotas, cosine, minimal, ablation" and ensure the abstract stays under 100 words. I''ll include a bullet list of results and metrics, focusing solely on the findings.**Crafting Archive Capsule Content**


