    **Score:** 0.5252766818624102\n**ASW_batch:** 0.667\n**ASW_label:** 0.205\n**ARI:** 0.748\n**NMI:** 0.730\n**Graph_conn:** 0.936\n**kBET:** 0.608\n**iLISI:** 0.160\n**cLISI:** 0.918\n**PCR:** 0.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.281\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.667  ASW_label: 0.205  ARI: 0.748  NMI: 0.730\n  Graph_conn: 0.936  kBET: 0.608  iLISI: 0.160  cLISI: 0.918\n  PCR: 0.000  Cell_cycle: 0.281\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.833884  ASW_label: 0.529749  ARI: 0.748335  NMI: 0.729758\n  Graph_conn: 0.937209  kBET: 0.582808  iLISI: 0.159776  cLISI: 0.976097\n  PCR: 0.000000  Cell_cycle: 0.248933\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n\
    \  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/d68d457e-586c-4970-bca1-d98a56802094/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: d68d457e-586c-4970-bca1-d98a56802094\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Ridge GraphFWPCA + neighbors meta — kq=1024, mutual=1.0, row-norm=True (δ=0.12, k=50, kd=22)' (ID: 1613) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.529892880706874\n**ASW_batch:** 0.667\n**ASW_label:** 0.205\n**ARI:** 0.772\n**NMI:** 0.731\n**Graph_conn:** 0.936\n**kBET:** 0.609\n**iLISI:** 0.160\n**cLISI:** 0.918\n**PCR:** 0.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.302\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.667  ASW_label: 0.205  ARI: 0.772  NMI: 0.731\n  Graph_conn: 0.936  kBET: 0.609  iLISI: 0.160  cLISI: 0.918\n  PCR: 0.000  Cell_cycle: 0.302\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.833884  ASW_label: 0.529749  ARI: 0.772248  NMI: 0.731123\n  Graph_conn: 0.937209  kBET: 0.583309  iLISI:\
    \ 0.159776  cLISI: 0.976097\n  PCR: 0.000000  Cell_cycle: 0.266270\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/0661ebc6-167c-4a56-876c-a781cb08a7ff/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 0661ebc6-167c-4a56-876c-a781cb08a7ff\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n2. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n3. `goto private_memory` (in Research Counter);\n4. `reply 101` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n\
