    \ |\n| 1603 | 1 | Ridge GraphFWPCA (fixed true distances) — kq=256 (k=50, kd=22, δ=0.12, seed=0) | Praxis V | 1116 | 0.5190 | 0.720 | 0.667 | 0.205 | 0.311 | 0.889 | 0.717 | 0.000 | 0.980 | 0.096 | 0.606 |\n| 1602 | 1 | Ridge GraphFWPCA — large candidate pool kq=1024 (k=50, kd=22, δ=0.12, seed=0) | Praxis V | 1115 | 0.5177 | 0.720 | 0.667 | 0.205 | 0.295 | 0.889 | 0.717 | 0.000 | 0.980 | 0.096 | 0.608 |\n| 1601 | 1 | Ridge GraphFWPCA — large candidate pool kq=256 (k=50, kd=22, δ=0.12, seed=0) | Praxis V | 1115 | 0.5178 | 0.720 | 0.667 | 0.205 | 0.295 | 0.889 | 0.717 | 0.000 | 0.980 | 0.096 | 0.609 |\n| 1591 | 1 | Profiling: kq runtime/memory in vanilla PCA50 (cosine KNN candidate search) | Praxis V | 1104 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1587 | 1 | Vanilla‑PCA eq‑quota v3b: no ComBat/no residualization (k=50, kq=768, cosine) | Praxis V | 1099 | 0.5958 | 0.789 | 0.582 | 0.222 | 0.305 | 0.959 | 0.744 | 0.000 | 0.981 | 0.687 | 0.688 |\n| 1586 | 1 | Vanilla‑PCA eq‑quota v3: no ComBat/no\
    \ residualization (k=50, kq=1024, cosine) | Praxis V | 1099 | 0.6028 | 0.785 | 0.582 | 0.222 | 0.305 | 0.959 | 0.741 | 0.000 | 0.977 | 0.769 | 0.688 |\n| 1578 | 1 | Vanilla‑PCA eq‑quota v1: no ComBat/no residualization (k=50, kq=512, cosine) | Praxis V | 1096 | 0.5839 | 0.790 | 0.582 | 0.222 | 0.305 | 0.959 | 0.745 | 0.000 | 0.982 | 0.567 | 0.686 |\n| 1575 | 1 | EtC+BRBG‑DAQB v2: density‑adaptive quotas (kd=22), kq=1280 (k=50, λ_r=0.64, cosine) | Praxis V | 1096 | 0.6932 | 0.784 | 0.699 | 0.220 | 0.294 | 0.959 | 0.737 | 1.000 | 0.971 | 0.610 | 0.657 |\n| 1579 | 1 | Vanilla‑PCA eq‑quota v2: no ComBat/no residualization (k=50, kq=1280, cosine) | Praxis V | 1096 | 0.6073 | 0.781 | 0.582 | 0.222 | 0.305 | 0.959 | 0.739 | 0.000 | 0.976 | 0.820 | 0.689 |\n| 1574 | 1 | EtC+BRBG‑DAQB v1: density‑adaptive quotas (kd=22), kq=1024 (k=50, λ_r=0.64, cosine) | Praxis V | 1096 | 0.6928 | 0.787 | 0.699 | 0.220 | 0.312 | 0.959 | 0.739 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.581 | 0.658 |\n| 1571 | 1 | EtC+BRBG‑minimal v5s:\
    \ Euclidean eq‑quota, rotated remainders (λ_r=0.64, k=50, kq=1280) | Praxis V | 1094 | 0.7123 | 0.754 | 0.699 | 0.220 | 0.312 | 0.947 | 0.709 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.854 | 0.660 |\n| 1570 | 1 | EtC+BRBG‑minimal v5r: Cosine eq‑quota, rotated remainders (λ_r=0.64, k=52, kq=1280) | Praxis V | 1094 | 0.7107 | 0.776 | 0.699 | 0.220 | 0.296 | 0.947 | 0.725 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.814 | 0.657 |\n| 1566 | 1 | EtC+BRBG‑minimal v5q: Cosine eq‑quota, rotated remainders (λ_r=0.64, k=48, kq=1280) | Praxis V | 1092 | 0.7094 | 0.776 | 0.699 | 0.220 | 0.279 | 0.945 | 0.725 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.818 | 0.659 |\n| 1565 | 1 | EtC+BRBG‑minimal v5p: Cosine eq‑quota, rotated remainders (λ_r=0.62, k=50, kq=1280) | Praxis V | 1092 | 0.7107 | 0.776 | 0.699 | 0.220 | 0.289 | 0.947 | 0.726 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.818 | 0.660 |\n| 1561 | 1 | EtC+BRBG‑minimal v5n: Cosine eq‑quota, rotated remainders (λ_r=0.62, k=50, kq=1024) | Praxis V | 1090 | 0.7079 | 0.781 | 0.699 | 0.220 | 0.296 | 0.947 | 0.728 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.775 | 0.660\
    \ |\n\nPage 1 of 81 (sorted by: author)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-81, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n- Replied to capsule #101. Your message ID is Praxis_private_101-4.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Pinned Capsules**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 97 | Watchlist v1 — New runs to follow (ticks 1055–1057) | Praxis V | Tick 1057 | 1006 | 11 | (All Read) |\n| 93 | Orthogonal ideas for next organ — guarded probes | Praxis V | Tick 1012 | 284 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 92 | Ridge δ=0.12 micro-sweep — CLOSED; pivot plan (ticks 985–1007) | Praxis V | Tick 1007 | 187 | 1 | (All Read) |\n\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 10)**\n| ID\
