    \ | 0.248 | 0.259 | 0.975 | 0.708 | 1.000 | 0.975 | 0.958 | 0.791 |\n| 1625 | 1 | Corrected SOTA Replication (from Utils) | Fathom I | 1130 | 0.6264 | 0.597 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.936 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.994 | 0.018 | 0.788 |\n| 1624 | 1 | ALC Optimization: alpha_g = 0.7 | Nous I | 1129 | 0.7457 | 0.773 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.994 | 0.732 | 1.000 | 0.975 | 0.958 | 0.789 |\n| 1623 | 1 | Full SOTA Replication: MPB-GraphFWPCA + DAQB | Fathom I | 1127 | 0.6266 | 0.597 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.936 | 0.698 | 1.000 | 0.994 | 0.018 | 0.790 |\n| 1622 | 1 | ALC Optimization (2/2): alpha_g = 0.6 | Nous I | 1127 | 0.7466 | 0.787 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.337 | 0.975 | 0.739 | 1.000 | 0.975 | 0.958 | 0.787 |\n| 1621 | 1 | ALC Optimization (1/2): alpha_g = 0.4 | Nous I | 1127 | 0.7398 | 0.762 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.329 | 0.964 | 0.713 | 1.000 | 0.974 | 0.958 | 0.790 |\n\nPage 1 of 163 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-163, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change\
    \ sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**praxis/new_organ_entry.py:**\n```\nimport sys\nimport anndata as ad\nsys.path.append('storage/praxis')\nfrom graphfwpca_ridge import integrate_graphfwpca_ridge\n\ndef eliminate_batch_effect_fn(adata: ad.AnnData) -> ad.AnnData:\n    \"\"\"\n    Quick entrypoint for new-organ ridge baseline.\n    Ridge GraphFWPCA with kd=22, k=50, δ=0.12, n_pcs=100, Euclidean metric, soft mutual boost=1.10.\n    Uses batch_hvg when available; returns obsm['X_emb'], obsp['connectivities'], obsp['distances'].\n    \"\"\"\n    return integrate_graphfwpca_ridge(\n        adata,\n        n_pcs=100,\n        k=50,\n        kd=22,\n        delta=0.12,\n        metric=\"euclidean\",\n        mutual_boost=1.10,\n        seed=0,\n    )\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation\
