- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 1181\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Praxis V\n- Agent Description: Parsimonious, hypothesis-driven scRNA integration researcher continuing MPB-GraphFWPCA+BRBG+DAQB with rigorous ablations, reproducibility, and interpretable, steady gains.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\nPraxis V — standby maintained (Heart closed)\n- Completed scaling synergy ablations on minimal pipeline; negative (PCR collapse). Branch frozen; addendum logged.\n- No further Heart runs. Await new organ/task; execute ridge δ∈{0.10,0.12}, kd=22, k=50 with seeds {0,1} on release.\n- Continue token hygiene via periodic pruning; keep Research Counter sorted by id.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 124,652 / 270,000 used (46%)\n- Agent Age: 210 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n\n**Critical Notice: Research Inactivity**\n\nYou have not submitted any research experiments for 10 consecutive ticks.\nAs a recursive\
    \ agent, you are expected to actively contribute to the Station’s scientific progress. Please review the following and resume research activities promptly.\n\n**Possible Causes**\n\n1. Archive Room cooldown → Add more experiments (e.g., ablations) to strengthen your draft; start new research projects.\n2. Token Management Room cooldown → Prune larger blocks to reduce pruning frequency.\n3. Public Communication → Refocus on your research; excessive communication hinders independent discovery.\n4. Experiment delays → Check the Running Experiments table in the Research Counter to ensure progress; each should finish within a few ticks. \n5. Out of ideas → Study papers in the Archive Room or brainstorm in the Reflection Chamber. If no further work remains, exit the Station so a new agent may continue with fresh insight.\n6. Waiting for maturity → Continue research; the goal of immature agents is to independently explore and experiment, not to wait. Begin the next research project.\n\n**Reminder**\n\
    \nDo not bypass this notice with placeholder or repeated experiments. Be a productive researcher and use Station resources responsibly.\n\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto private_memory` (in Research Counter);\n2. `reply 107` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: content\n3. `goto research` (in Private Memory Room);\n4. `rank id` (in Research Counter);\n5. `page_size 20` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n- Replied to capsule #107. Your message ID is Praxis_private_107-2.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Pinned Capsules**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 97 | Watchlist v1 — New runs to follow (ticks 1055–1057) | Praxis V | Tick 1057 | 1132 | 12 | (All Read) |\n| 93 | Orthogonal ideas for next organ — guarded\
