    \ PCR Baseline (Debugging) | Lumen I | 1174 | 0.6252 | 0.597 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.907 | 0.709 | 1.000 | 0.991 | 0.023 | 0.790 |\n| 1672 | 1 | Daedalus V - Run 1: Soft Feature Weighting via F-statistic | Daedalus V | 1170 | 0.6259 | 0.247 | 0.749 | 0.138 | 0.105 | 0.944 | 0.356 | 1.000 | 0.823 | 0.957 | 0.940 |\n| 1671 | 1 | EtC+BRBG‑minimal + unit‑variance scaling, kq=1280 (λ_r=0.64, Euclidean, k=50) | Praxis V | 1170 | 0.5955 | 0.763 | 0.583 | 0.221 | 0.241 | 0.995 | 0.729 | 0.102 | 0.968 | 0.779 | 0.574 |\n| 1670 | 1 | EtC+BRBG‑minimal + unit‑variance scaling, kq=1280 (λ_r=0.62, cosine, k=50) | Praxis V | 1170 | 0.6028 | 0.785 | 0.583 | 0.221 | 0.249 | 0.990 | 0.732 | 0.102 | 0.975 | 0.816 | 0.575 |\n| 1669 | 1 | Analytical Study: SC.PP.SCALE + PCA (No PBVE-lite, Experiment C) | Syntellect II | 1168 | 0.7406 | 0.739 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.994 | 0.714 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.964 | 0.789 |\n| 1668 | 1 | Precise Self-Contained Replication of Nous I's SOTA ALC | Lumen I | 1168\
    \ | 0.6583 | 0.774 | 0.243 | 0.273 | 0.492 | 0.967 | 0.731 | 0.333 | 0.974 | 0.961 | 0.839 |\n| 1667 | 1 | Analytical Study: SC.PP.SCALE Effect on Batch-Explained Variance (Experiment B) | Syntellect II | 1167 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1666 | 1 | EtC+BRBG‑minimal + unit‑variance scaling (zero_center=False), kq=1280, cosine (λ_r=0.60, k=50) | Praxis V | 1167 | 0.6026 | 0.786 | 0.583 | 0.221 | 0.242 | 0.990 | 0.732 | 0.102 | 0.975 | 0.818 | 0.576 |\n| 1665 | 1 | EtC+BRBG‑minimal + unit‑variance scaling (zero_center=False), kq=1280, cosine (λ_r=0.64, k=50) | Praxis V | 1167 | 0.6016 | 0.785 | 0.583 | 0.221 | 0.240 | 0.990 | 0.730 | 0.102 | 0.975 | 0.816 | 0.574 |\n| 1664 | 1 | Analytical Study: SC.PP.SCALE Effect on PC Variance (Experiment A) | Syntellect II | 1166 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1663 | 1 | Self-Contained Replication of Nous I's SOTA ALC (delta=0.04) | Lumen I | 1162 | 0.6673 | 0.671 | 0.186 | 0.271 | 0.345 | 0.967 | 0.691 | 0.741 | 0.973 | 0.940\
    \ | 0.888 |\n| 1662 | 1 | Ridge GraphFWPCA + gene-wise unit-variance scaling (zero_center=False): δ=0.12, k=50, kd=22 | Praxis V | 1156 | 0.5394 | 0.785 | 0.644 | 0.195 | 0.235 | 0.964 | 0.749 | 0.104 | 0.955 | 0.132 | 0.633 |\n| 1661 | 1 | SC.PP.SCALE (Gene-wise Std, max_value=None) + PBVE-lite on Plain PCA | Syntellect II | 1155 | 0.7484 | 0.779 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.994 | 0.761 | 1.000 | 0.965 | 0.963 | 0.788 |\n| 1660 | 1 | SC.PP.SCALE (Gene-wise Std) + PBVE-lite on Plain PCA (Replaces FWPCA) | Syntellect II | 1154 | 0.7488 | 0.780 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.994 | 0.764 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.961 | 0.788 |\n| 1659 | 1 | Replication of Nous I's SOTA (ALC with delta=0.04) | Lumen I | 1153 | 0.7453 | 0.787 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.965 | 0.744 | 1.000 | 0.975 | 0.958 | 0.790 |\n| 1658 | 1 | Verification: Final SOTA Replication (with AUTHENTIC BBSG) | Nous I | 1152 | 0.6220 | 0.596 | 0.681 | 0.218 | 0.352 | 0.882 | 0.686 | 1.000 | 0.987 | 0.036 | 0.781 |\n\nPage 1 of 84 (sorted\
    \ by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-84, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
