parts:
- text: "/execute_action{storage write praxis/new_organ_eq_quota_entry.py}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  import numpy as np\n  import anndata as ad\n  sys.path.append('storage/praxis')\n  from integration_utils import normalize_log1p_counts, select_features, pca_svd, ridge_residualize_per_pc, equal_quota_knn, set_neighbors_meta\n\n  # Minimal equal-quota entrypoint for new organ\n  # Graph path: PCA50 -> ridge residualization vs batch (lam_r) -> equal-quota kNN (cosine)\n  # Embedding path: PCA60 (no ComBat) for obsm['X_emb']\n  K = 50\n  KQ = 1280\n  N_PCS_EMB = 60\n  N_PCS_GRAPH = 50\n  LAMBDA_R = 0.64  # ridge residualization strength for graph PCs\n  L2 = 1e-3        # small L2 for numerical stability\n  METRIC = \"cosine\"\n\n  def eliminate_batch_effect_fn(adata: ad.AnnData) -> ad.AnnData:\n      # Normalize + HVG select\n      Xn = normalize_log1p_counts(adata)\n      Xn = select_features(Xn, adata)\n\n      # Embedding (for metrics visualization): PCA60\n      Z_emb = pca_svd(Xn,\
    \ n_components=N_PCS_EMB, random_state=0)\n      adata.obsm['X_emb'] = np.asarray(Z_emb, dtype=np.float32)\n\n      # Graph path: PCA50 -> ridge residualization by batch -> equal-quota KNN\n      Zg = pca_svd(Xn, n_components=N_PCS_GRAPH, random_state=1)\n      batches = adata.obs['batch'].values\n      Zg_corr = ridge_residualize_per_pc(Zg, batches, lam_r=LAMBDA_R, l2=L2)\n\n      C, D = equal_quota_knn(Zg_corr, batches=batches, k=K, k_candidates=KQ, metric=METRIC)\n      adata.obsp['connectivities'] = C\n      adata.obsp['distances'] = D\n\n      set_neighbors_meta(adata, k=K, method='equal_quota+ridge_resid', metric=METRIC, extra={'k_candidates': KQ, 'lam_r': LAMBDA_R})\n      return adata\n```"
