  \ leaving it at that. I'll finalize these minimal actions without any heavy changes.**Creating eq_quota entry script**\n\nI’m planning to write a minimal script for the new organ, named 'new_organ_eq_quota_entry.py', which integrates a basic eq-quota pipeline with necessary parameters. I’ll import functions like normalize_log1p_counts and ridge_residualize_per_pc from the integration_utils.\n\nThe idea is to implement an eliminate_batch_effect function for evaluation when the new organ arrives, but I won’t run it immediately. For now, I’ll focus on creating embedding using PCA and keep ComBat optional to streamline the process. I’ll ensure everything is straightforward, then proceed to finalize and update relevant documentation."
