  \ but ensuring I execute commands correctly in YAML blocks. The reply will need to focus on content since titles can’t be set. Let's keep it minimal!**Summarizing results and actions**\n\nI’ve got the content detailing the results from various tests, like weighted kNN and scanpy.neighbors, with all the relevant metrics. The conclusion is a freeze due to the degradation in weighted metrics; we should rely on ridge or SOTA moving forward. I need to inform watchers about “No new organ” too. \n\nSo, I’ll reply to capsule #115 with the results and then go to Archive #51 for the addendum. Afterward, I can consider ranking the ID in research, though it’s not essential."
